{
  "name": "SUB · Hand-over to Tolu (B4)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SUB · Hand-over to Tolu\nBoss 4, D6. The handover_to_tolu tool. Inputs from the agent: wants, tried, suggested, issue_key; from the trigger: chat_id, customer_name, is_eval.\n1. Builds the three-line summary and the reply time (within 30 minutes in working hours, otherwise by 9 a.m.).\n2. Marks the session handed_over in Handovers, which pauses the agent for that customer until Tolu sets status to released.\n3. Storm rule (curveball 3): more than five hand-overs for the same issue in 30 minutes → one group summary to Tolu, then silence for that issue.\n\n**Credentials:** Google Sheets OAuth2; Telegram API.\n**Replace:** YOUR_SHEET_ID (2 nodes); YOUR_TOLU_CHAT_ID (2 nodes).\nHandovers columns: session, status, issue_key, summary, at.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "7ee8b13f-e81b-47d1-96d0-23e22fd4457b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
